{"id":"9846c377383d14c1","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-omega.md","title":"Natural Numbers and Finite Tuples","display":"df-omega — Natural Numbers and Finite Tuples","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-omega","aliases":["90-df-omega"],"display":"df-omega — Natural Numbers and Finite Tuples","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-omega"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-omega</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-omega — Natural Numbers and Finite Tuples"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>背景为经典集合论；有序对、函数图、幂集、并集与整数使用集合论元语言。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 为一个归纳集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,n,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 为唯一的空列。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^n\">\\(A^n\\)</span> 的元素是定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\">\\(n=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\)</span> 的函数。有限列的下标从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 开始；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_i=s(i)\">\\(s_i=s(i)\\)</span>。本书将一元数值输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 与唯一的一元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x\\rangle\">\\(\\langle x\\rangle\\)</span> 作类型化识别，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N^0=\\{\\epsilon\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N^0=\\{\\epsilon\\}\\)</span>；不同元数在调用处固定。</li>\n<li>下式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,+,\\cdot,&lt;,\\le\">\\(0,+,\\cdot,&lt;,\\le\\)</span> 属元语言自然数运算；对象语言算术符号另由本书算术签名解释。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ind}(A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\varnothing\\in A\\land\\forall x\\in A\\ (x\\cup\\{x\\}\\in A),\\\\\n\\omega&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{A\\subseteq I:\\operatorname{Ind}(A)\\},\\qquad\\mathbb N\\coloneqq\\omega,\\\\\n0&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad n+1\\coloneqq n\\cup\\{n\\},\\\\\nn&lt;m&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow n\\in m,\\qquad n\\le m\\Longleftrightarrow n\\subseteq m,\\\\\nn+0&amp;\\coloneqq n,\\qquad n+(m+1)\\coloneqq(n+m)+1,\\\\\nn\\cdot0&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\qquad n\\cdot(m+1)\\coloneqq n\\cdot m+n,\\\\\nn^0&amp;\\coloneqq1,\\qquad n^{m+1}\\coloneqq n^m\\cdot n,\\\\\nA^n&amp;\\coloneqq\\{s:s:n\\to A\\},\\qquad A^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}A^n,\\\\\nA^*&amp;\\coloneqq A^{&lt;\\omega},\\qquad\\epsilon\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad A^0=\\{\\epsilon\\},\\qquad\n|s|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\quad(s\\in A^{&lt;\\omega}),\\\\\ns{}^\\frown t&amp;\\coloneqq s\\cup\\{(|s|+i,t_i):i&lt;|t|\\}\n\\quad(s,t\\in A^{&lt;\\omega}),\\\\\n\\langle a\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(0,a)\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{one}_A\\coloneqq\\{(a,\\langle a\\rangle):a\\in A\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{one}_A&amp;:A\\xrightarrow{\\sim}A^1.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ind}(A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\varnothing\\in A\\land\\forall x\\in A\\ (x\\cup\\{x\\}\\in A),\\\\\n\\omega&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{A\\subseteq I:\\operatorname{Ind}(A)\\},\\qquad\\mathbb N\\coloneqq\\omega,\\\\\n0&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad n+1\\coloneqq n\\cup\\{n\\},\\\\\nn&lt;m&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow n\\in m,\\qquad n\\le m\\Longleftrightarrow n\\subseteq m,\\\\\nn+0&amp;\\coloneqq n,\\qquad n+(m+1)\\coloneqq(n+m)+1,\\\\\nn\\cdot0&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\qquad n\\cdot(m+1)\\coloneqq n\\cdot m+n,\\\\\nn^0&amp;\\coloneqq1,\\qquad n^{m+1}\\coloneqq n^m\\cdot n,\\\\\nA^n&amp;\\coloneqq\\{s:s:n\\to A\\},\\qquad A^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}A^n,\\\\\nA^*&amp;\\coloneqq A^{&lt;\\omega},\\qquad\\epsilon\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad A^0=\\{\\epsilon\\},\\qquad\n|s|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\quad(s\\in A^{&lt;\\omega}),\\\\\ns{}^\\frown t&amp;\\coloneqq s\\cup\\{(|s|+i,t_i):i&lt;|t|\\}\n\\quad(s,t\\in A^{&lt;\\omega}),\\\\\n\\langle a\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(0,a)\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{one}_A\\coloneqq\\{(a,\\langle a\\rangle):a\\in A\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{one}_A&amp;:A\\xrightarrow{\\sim}A^1.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本文件依据第 90 本实际调用的接口补齐未提供的外部依赖，供本书内部使用；不声称复原未提供的外部原文。 原自然数域含零；不把零元输入删除，也不将集合论有限列等同于后续的自然数序列码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"m,n,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"A^n","display":false},{"tex":"n=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"s_i=s(i)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N^0=\\{\\epsilon\\}","display":false},{"tex":"0,+,\\cdot,<,\\le","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ind}(A)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\varnothing\\in A\\land\\forall x\\in A\\ (x\\cup\\{x\\}\\in A),\\\\\n\\omega&\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{A\\subseteq I:\\operatorname{Ind}(A)\\},\\qquad\\mathbb N\\coloneqq\\omega,\\\\\n0&\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad n+1\\coloneqq n\\cup\\{n\\},\\\\\nn<m&\\Longleftrightarrow n\\in m,\\qquad n\\le m\\Longleftrightarrow n\\subseteq m,\\\\\nn+0&\\coloneqq n,\\qquad n+(m+1)\\coloneqq(n+m)+1,\\\\\nn\\cdot0&\\coloneqq0,\\qquad n\\cdot(m+1)\\coloneqq n\\cdot m+n,\\\\\nn^0&\\coloneqq1,\\qquad n^{m+1}\\coloneqq n^m\\cdot n,\\\\\nA^n&\\coloneqq\\{s:s:n\\to A\\},\\qquad A^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}A^n,\\\\\nA^*&\\coloneqq A^{<\\omega},\\qquad\\epsilon\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad A^0=\\{\\epsilon\\},\\qquad\n|s|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\quad(s\\in A^{<\\omega}),\\\\\ns{}^\\frown t&\\coloneqq s\\cup\\{(|s|+i,t_i):i<|t|\\}\n\\quad(s,t\\in A^{<\\omega}),\\\\\n\\langle a\\rangle&\\coloneqq\\{(0,a)\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{one}_A\\coloneqq\\{(a,\\langle a\\rangle):a\\in A\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{one}_A&:A\\xrightarrow{\\sim}A^1.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2172,"backlinks":[{"id":"278a6c2cfc6160a3","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb N$ 与集合论自然数运算取 [[90-df-omega]] 的语境；下式解释映射中的数值 $0,n+1,m+n,mn$ 属于该元语言，不是未解释的对象符号。"},{"id":"e666e28fc8018212","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"自然数集见 [[90-df-omega]]；函数以其有定义域的图表示，有限列采用集合论有限列。"},{"id":"20b828a641244a9a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb{N}$ (自然数集, see [[90-df-omega]])"},{"id":"f0ea0e26dd8bcf09","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$x,y\\in\\mathbb N$；加法、乘法及次序采用 [[90-df-omega]] 的自然数语境。"},{"id":"eb8e9519813ba70b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"有限列、空列与 $A^*$ 使用 [[90-df-omega]]。$P_j(\\vec t)$ 是下式定义的带谓词标签与有序词模式列的语法对象，不是谓词符号的真值求值；$r_j=0$ 时使用唯一空列。"},{"id":"8f303a307372354c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f2f6e5380b315983","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"523fadf1703582fe","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$、$P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{k+1}$ 为任意关系，不预设可判定或可枚举；自然数及次序见 [[90-df-omega]]，部分函数见 [[90-df-partial-function]]。"},{"id":"65cecff06a8bc84e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$g:\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\to\\mathbb N$ 是全函数；自然数及次序见 [[90-df-omega]]，部分函数见 [[90-df-partial-function]]。"},{"id":"0771a0b97a16ee5a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb{N}$ (自然数集, see [[90-df-omega]])"},{"id":"ac2460aba5c368e5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$；$g:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N$、$h:\\mathbb N^{k+2}\\to\\mathbb N$ 为全函数；$\\mathbb N^0=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}$。自然数递归的背景取原自然数集语境 [[90-df-omega]]。"},{"id":"4d499aedd34b7bfd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb{N}$ (自然数集, see [[90-df-omega]])"},{"id":"00ee901093c12d44","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4badec96813b3395","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B,C$ 为集合，$R\\subseteq A\\times B$、$S\\subseteq B\\times C$。有序对和有限元组按 [[90-df-omega]] 的集合论约定。"},{"id":"5dc32170bd55a322","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb N$ 取 [[90-df-omega]]；$p_i$、$\\operatorname{Prime}$ 取 [[90-df-prime-number]]，$\\mid$ 取 [[90-df-divisibility]]。"},{"id":"b769360437f9e54a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb{N}$ (自然数集, see [[90-df-omega]])"},{"id":"82c921b871f2639b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9f760cc852de5c08","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"99273534f93e4ad1","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f:=\\mu P$ 取 [[90-df-min-operator-generalized]] 的最小化部分函数图；元数为 $k$。自然数语境保留原引用 [[90-df-omega]]。"},{"id":"7232dda6455e1c93","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"10ddd9c20c6edffd","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-omega]]"},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-10